  "texts": {
    "preamble": "V.Maruthi Prasad vs State Represented By on 6 July, 2020 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Crl.Op. No. 3441 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 06.07.2020 Coram The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Crl. O.P. No. 3441 of 2020 V.Maruthi Prasad, S/o. Venkatramiah, Gandhi Road, Shankar Nagar, Chennai. .. Pet vs. State represented by The Inspector of Police, Kaveripattinam Police Station, Krishnagiri District. (Crime No. 312 of 2017) .. Respon Prayer:",
    "facts": "This petition has been filed for direction directing the respondent Police to open the lock and seal of the shed bearing No. 959A bearing Survey No. 420/06, 421/B1, 421/B2, 427/1B1, Permankottai, Pannihalli, Kaveripattinam, Krishnagiri District and hand over the custody to the petitioner concerned in Crime No. 312/2017 pending on the file of Inspector of Police, Kaveripattinam Police Station, Krishnagiri District. 2. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor submitted that the said custody belongs to the petitioner and also his vehicle was seized in pursuant to the case registered in Crime No. 312 of 2017 for the offences under Section 336 IPC, under Section 7 of Cigaratte and other Tobacco Products Acts 2003, under Section 3(1) (zz) (iii), under Section 265 (1)(2)(i)(iv) and under Section 27 of Food Safety and Standard Act 2006. He further submits that the investigation has been completed and the respondent Police is ready to de-seal the premises and also ready to return the vehicle which was seized.",
